[94.525994, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\npython - <<'PY'\r\nmods=['torch','transformers','peft','sentencepiece','huggingface_hub','numpy']\r\nfor m in mods:\r\n    try:\r\n        mod=__import__(m)\r\n        print(m, getattr(mod,'__version__','?'))\r\n    except Exception as e:\r\n        print(m, 'MISSING', e)\r\nPY\r\npip --version\r\ncurl -sI https://huggingface.co | head -5 || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
