[106.751756, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m3\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[106.751868, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll set up the Python dependencies, inspect the adapter’s configuration, and then build a reproducible script that configures, merges, verifies, and saves the \r\nrequired outputs.\r\n\r\n```\r\npip install --no-cache-dir torch transformers peft sentencepiece safetensors accelerate 2>&1 | tail -40\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[106.75209, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[136.788131, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n<returncode>\r\n-1\r\n<output>\r\n\r\n<exception_info>\r\nAn error occurred while executing the command: Command 'pip install --no-cache-dir torch transformers peft sentencepiece safetensors accelerate 2>&1 | tail -40'\r\ntimed out after 30 seconds\r\n"]
