[280.502675, "o", "\r\u001b[2KDependencies are installed on CPU. Next I’ll fetch the adapter metadata and repository file listing first, since its label mapping and PEFT target modules \r\ndetermine the correct merge procedure.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nfrom huggingface_hub import HfApi, hf_hub_download\r\napi=HfApi()\r\nfor repo in ['dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection','FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base']:\r\n    print('\\nREPO', repo)\r\n    try:\r\n        info=api.model_info(repo, files_metadata=True)\r\n        print('sha', info.sha)\r\n        for f in info.siblings:\r\n            print(f.rfilename, f.size)\r\n    except Exception as e:\r\n        print('ERR', repr(e))\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
