[335.202588, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nfrom huggingface_hub import hf_hub_download\r\nimport torch\r\np=hf_hub_download('dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection','adapter_model.bin',local_dir='/app/adapter_files')\r\nsd=torch.load(p,map_location='cpu',weights_only=True)\r\nfor k,v in sd.items():\r\n    print(k, tuple(v.shape))\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
