[353.633946, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe adapter uses LoRA on query/value projections and saves the full 20-class classifier as a PEFT `modules_to_save` component. I’ll now download the base \r\nweights and tokenizer files locally, then verify the adapter keys before attempting the merge.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && cat > /app/download_models.py <<'PY'\r\nfrom huggingface_hub import snapshot_download\r\nimport time\r\nprint('Downloading base model...', flush=True)\r\nt=time.time()\r\np=snapshot_download(\r\n    repo_id='FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base',\r\n    local_dir='/app/base_model_download',\r\n    allow_patterns=['config.json','model.safetensors','sentencepiece.bpe.model','tokenizer.json','tokenizer_config.json','special_tokens_map.json'],\r\n)\r\nprint('base done', p, time.time()-t, flush=True)\r\nprint('Downloading adapter...', flush=True)\r\nt=time.time()\r\np=snapshot_download(\r\n    repo_id='dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection',\r\n    local_dir='/app/adapter_download',\r\n    allow_patterns=['adapter_config.json','adapter_model.bin','config.json','README."]
[353.634178, "o", "md'],\r\n)\r\nprint('adapter done', p, time.time()-t, flush=True)\r\nPY\r\nnohup python /app/download_models.py > /app/download_models.log 2>&1 & echo $! > /app/download_models.pid; sleep 5; tail -10 /app/download_models.log\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
