[459.362994, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m22\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2KThe saved configs correctly expose `num_labels=20` and the merged checkpoint reloads standalone. I’ll run a sanity benchmark against the public 20-language test\r\nCSV for stronger verification of overall and per-language accuracy.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nfrom huggingface_hub import hf_hub_download\r\np=hf_hub_download('papluca/language-identification','test.csv',repo_type='dataset',local_dir='/app/langid_data')\r\nprint(p)\r\nimport csv\r\nfrom collections import Counter\r\nwith open(p, encoding='utf-8') as f:\r\n    r=csv.DictReader(f)\r\n    print(r.fieldnames)\r\n    rows=list(r)\r\nprint('rows',len(rows),Counter(x.get('labels') or x.get('label') for x in rows))\r\nprint(rows[:3])\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
