[536.127166, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\nhead -20 /app/evaluate_langid.log; python - <<'PY'\r\nimport json,re\r\ns=open('/app/evaluate_langid.log').read()\r\nprint('overall' in s)\r\nprint(re.findall(r'\"overall_accuracy\": ([0-9.]+)',s))\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
